      "title": "fix(ci): cache key may list at most two files",
      "message": "fix(ci): cache key may list at most two files\n\nGitLab rejects more than two entries under cache:key:files, so the whole\nconfiguration was invalid and pipeline #1 failed at creation with no jobs and\nno stages:\n\n  default:cache:key:files config has too many items (maximum is 2)\n\nKey on build.gradle.kts and gradle.properties, the two files that decide what\nGradle resolves. Dropping gradle-wrapper.properties only means a Gradle\nversion bump reuses the key and adds the new distribution to the cached\nwrapper dir.\n\nAlso mark gradlew executable: it was committed 100644 from Windows, so a Linux\ncheckout got a non-executable wrapper. CI chmods it in before_script, but the\nbit belongs in the tree for anyone cloning on Linux.\n",
      "author_name": "Linus Fischer",
      "author_email": "leicraft@leicraftmc.de",
      "authored_date": "2026-10-16T20:17:25.000+02:00",
      "committer_name": "Linus Fischer",
      "committer_email": "leicraft@leicraftmc.de",
      "committed_date": "2026-10-16T20:20:33.000+02:00",
